# Verification and release

- Treat `tools/gates/inventory.json` and `tools/gates/required.json` as the gate inventory and
  required-set authorities. Keep recipe, inventory, workflow, and validation changes explicit.
- Use the relevant section of `docs/release-checklist.md`; do not load historical plans or
  receipts unless the task names them.
- A focused test, static check, or diagnostic subset is not a qualification receipt. Preserve
  the repository's exact-source and clean-tree requirements when changing proof producers.
- Add expensive work only to the explicit qualification path. Keep the laptop edit loop
  purpose-scoped and bounded.
